<title>USA: South Conway SD 17, Ark., won by Stephens.</title>
<headline>South Conway SD 17, Ark., won by Stephens.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stephens Inc said it won $5.555 million of South Conway County School District No. 17, Ark., general obligation refunding bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.1399 percent.</p>
</text>
